  "notes_en": [
    "Rate history covers policies dated from 1 April 2023; the earlier rate table is not collected.",
    "Launched 16 October 2019 (insurer's news release); yen was added from December 2019.",
    "Also sold as Premier Currency 3 Basic and Premier Currency M3 on the same rates; those names are not tracked separately.",
    "The maturity-focused plan with a 50% death benefit has shown no rates in recent periods.",
    "Maturity-focused plans (満期重視プラン, 生存保障重視型 in the policy terms) are filed as survival-weighted annuities: the death benefit and surrender value are capped at the premium times the death-benefit share, a charge for the death cover comes out of the account, and survivors get a larger maturity value. The Basic plan stays a fixed annuity."
  ],
